# What must never enter the build context.
#
# The first three are size and correctness: a host node_modules is the wrong platform's binaries,
# dist is rebuilt inside the image, and .git carries every version of every file ever committed
# here — including anything that was committed and then removed.
node_modules
dist
.git
.github
test
*.md
.DS_Store

# SECRETS. There is no .env in this repository and there must never be one — this bundle reads no
# build-time configuration at all (see vite.config.ts). These lines exist so that a file created
# by hand during an incident cannot be baked into an image that is then pushed to a registry.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
